      {
        "text": "Name: story premise - Kato, me, I \"inherit\" 3 ladies in my life after they fled from the legal trouble they were facing in Louisiana. After using my advanced AI skills, I made it appear that they went missing in Mexico and I mean who's going to go through all that for some black girls, of course racism works. Under my harsh hand and evil genius, we build one of the biggest media AI empires of America  \nType: Premise  \nDescription: A narrative centered on the protagonist, Kato, who takes in three women fleeing legal trouble in Louisiana. Using advanced AI skills, Kato fabricates their disappearance in Mexico, exploiting systemic racism to evade investigation. Under Kato's ruthless leadership, they establish a dominant media AI empire in America.  \nBackground: The story begins with the three women escaping Louisiana to avoid legal consequences. Kato, leveraging AI expertise, creates a false trail suggesting they vanished in Mexico, counting on societal indifference to their plight. Together, they rise to power in the media AI industry, guided by Kato's cunning and amorality.  \nSpecial Traits: Features themes of systemic racism, technological manipulation, and morally ambiguous ambition. Highlights Kato's strategic use of AI for deception and empire-building, as well as the exploitative dynamics within the group.",
        "contextConfig": {
