      {
        "text": "Name: Shamika Terry, 18, Friends with Ward Sisters  \nType: Character  \nDescription: Shamika Terry is an energetic and outgoing 18-year-old with a vibrant personality. She has curly dark hair, a warm smile, and a fashionable yet practical style. Often seen with her phone in hand, she’s the social glue of her friend group, always organizing hangouts and keeping up with the latest trends.  \nBackground: Shamika grew up in the same neighborhood as the Ward Sisters and has been their close friend since childhood. She comes from a supportive middle-class family and is currently a senior in high school, balancing academics with her active social life. Her bond with the Ward Sisters is unbreakable, and she often acts as the mediator during their occasional squabbles.  \nSpecial Traits: Shamika has a knack for diffusing tension with humor and is fiercely loyal to her friends. She’s also surprisingly tech-savvy, often helping the Ward Sisters with digital dilemmas. Her optimism is contagious, and she has a talent for turning even the dullest moments into fun adventures.",
