      {
        "text": "Name: Francesca Simmons  \nType: Character  \nDescription: A 20-year-old woman with a tall, dark complexion and long braids. She is a close friend of the Ward sisters and often seen in their company. Francesca carries herself with a confident yet approachable demeanor, exuding a quiet strength that draws others to her.  \nBackground: Francesca grew up in the same neighborhood as the Ward sisters, forming a tight-knit bond with them over the years. She comes from a supportive family and has always been the protective, level-headed one among her friends. Her friendship with the Wards is rooted in shared experiences, loyalty, and a deep understanding of one another.  \nSpecial Traits: Francesca is exceptionally observant, often noticing details others overlook. She has a knack for diffusing tense situations with her calm demeanor and sharp wit. Additionally, she is skilled at navigating social dynamics, making her a trusted confidante to the Ward sisters and their circle.",
