      {
        "text": "Name: Dee Dee  \nType: Character  \nDescription: A 21-year-old woman with a petite frame, sharp intelligence, and a mean streak. Her skin is a smooth, milk chocolate tone, often accentuated by her stylish yet intimidating attire. She carries herself with an air of confidence, her eyes always scanning for weaknesses in others.  \nBackground: Dee Dee grew up in a tough neighborhood, where she learned to be ruthless to survive. Despite her small stature, she quickly earned a reputation for being cunning and unyielding. She excelled academically, using her intelligence to outmaneuver rivals both in and out of the classroom. Now, she navigates the world with a sharp tongue and an even sharper mind, always staying one step ahead.  \nSpecial Traits: Highly intelligent and observant, able to read people with ease. Her meanness is often a defense mechanism, but she can also be genuinely cruel when provoked. Despite her demeanor, she has a soft spot for those who earn her trust—though such individuals are few and far between.",
